I'm getting a different build error after rebasing on top on `master` https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/af2c713971499953373380b9ae8673f64423bd59 on Linux:

```
Compiling scene/resources/scu/scu_scene_resources_4.gen.cpp ...
In file included from editor/scu/scu_editor_2.gen.cpp:2:
./editor/editor_build_profile.cpp: In member function 'void EditorBuildProfileManager::_detect_from_project()':
./editor/editor_build_profile.cpp:917:62: error: cannot convert 'List<StringName>*' to 'LocalVector<StringName>&'
  917 |                 ClassDB::get_inheriters_from_class(hc_class, &inheriters);
      |                                                              ^~~~~~~~~~~
      |                                                              |
      |                                                              List<StringName>*
In file included from ./core/object/ref_counted.h:33,
                 from ./core/object/script_instance.h:33,
                 from ./core/object/gdvirtual.gen.inc:4,
                 from ./scene/gui/control.h:34,
                 from ./scene/gui/container.h:33,
                 from ./scene/gui/box_container.h:33,
                 from ./editor/editor_autoload_settings.h:33,
                 from ./editor/editor_autoload_settings.cpp:31,
                 from editor/scu/scu_editor_2.gen.cpp:1:
./core/object/class_db.h:314:99: note:   initializing argument 2 of 'static void ClassDB::get_inheriters_from_class(const StringName&, LocalVector<StringName>&)'
  314 |         static void get_inheriters_from_class(const StringName &p_class, LocalVector<StringName> &p_classes);
      |                                                                          ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^~~~~~~~~
scons: *** [bin/obj/editor/scu/scu_editor_2.gen.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64.o] Error 1
```

It works if I don't rebase, so something broke during the rebase (it has no conflicts).

@Calinou The PR has been updated with the following:
- Improved the extraction of classes from binary scene files. This removes the need for `Skin` to be hardcoded.
- Added `ADD_CLASS_DEPENDENCY()`. This is used inside `_bind_methods()` so classes can mark if they depend on other classes being registered. This fixes the error with `TabBar`.
- Removed the logic to toggle advanced GUI in the build profile, [as stated by Akien](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103291#issuecomment-2788794427), that was made before this feature existed, and it's kinda redundant now.

@AThousandShips Changes made.
